 Very Good</td><td><a href="https://www.bluenile.com/diamond-details/30035525?a_aid=69d7c31a91b8d&a_cid=55e51e63&chan=blog-informational">$32,518</a></td><td>Max natural combo in current inventory. Overpaying — walk past.</td></tr></tbody></table>

